# Cloudflare Pages edge-cache headers.
# HTML is dynamic (SPA shell + fresh content): no browser cache, but a
# SHORT 60s shared edge cache so concurrent spikes share one origin
# fetch. Freshness is preserved: the service worker is network-first
# for navigations, and 60s is far below any content TTL.
# Vite-hashed /assets/* files are immutable and cache for a year.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, s-maxage=60, must-revalidate
